---
flowchart LR
  accTitle: PhysicsStepSystems::First · 对象关系
  accDescr: 中心对象与所有直接关联对象；完整保留入边、出边及原投影和注册身份，不递归展开间接关系。
  %% n*/e* 是业务节点/关系，sc* 是阶段关系；layout_* 仅用于排版。
  classDef node_system fill:#EFF3F8,stroke:#3567A6,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_system_set fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6A778C,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef node_engine_flow fill:#F1F5F4,stroke:#557C78,stroke-width:1.6px,color:#1F3340
  classDef edge_order stroke:#334155,stroke-width:2px
  classDef edge_set_membership stroke:#6A778C,stroke-width:1.4px,stroke-dasharray:2 4
  classDef edge_registration stroke:#64748B,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:6 4
  classDef external_node stroke-dasharray:6 4
  n0@{ shape: lin-rect, label: "**PhysicsStepSystems::First**<br/>在物理调度开头处理状态与关系变化。" }
  class n0 node_system_set
  n1@{ shape: stadium, label: "**main · PhysicsSchedule**<br/>来自Bevy 引擎 ↗：保存本应用调度的注册<br/>上下文与成员。" }
  class n1 node_engine_flow
  class n1 external_node
  n2@{ shape: rounded, label: "**update_child_collider_position**<br/>由所属刚体位姿更新附属碰撞体的世界位姿。" }
  class n2 node_system
  n3@{ shape: rounded, label: "**apply_contact_status_changes**<br/>把接触增删同步到约束图和物理岛。" }
  class n3 node_system
  n4@{ shape: rounded, label: "**on_change_joint_entities#lt;avian3d::**<br/>**dynamics::joints::fixed::FixedJoint#gt;**<br/>在关节换端后重接刚体连接图。" }
  class n4 node_system
  n5@{ shape: rounded, label: "**on_change_joint_entities#lt;avian3d::**<br/>**dynamics::joints::revolute::**<br/>**RevoluteJoint#gt;**<br/>在关节换端后重接刚体连接图。" }
  class n5 node_system
  n6@{ shape: rounded, label: "**on_change_joint_entities#lt;avian3d::**<br/>**dynamics::joints::prismatic::**<br/>**PrismaticJoint#gt;**<br/>在关节换端后重接刚体连接图。" }
  class n6 node_system
  n7@{ shape: rounded, label: "**on_change_joint_entities#lt;avian3d::**<br/>**dynamics::joints::distance::**<br/>**DistanceJoint#gt;**<br/>在关节换端后重接刚体连接图。" }
  class n7 node_system
  n8@{ shape: rounded, label: "**on_change_joint_entities#lt;avian3d::**<br/>**dynamics::joints::spherical::**<br/>**SphericalJoint#gt;**<br/>在关节换端后重接刚体连接图。" }
  class n8 node_system
  n9@{ shape: rounded, label: "**update_previous_velocity**<br/>更新平滑显示所需的历史速度快照。" }
  class n9 node_system
  n10@{ shape: lin-rect, label: "**PhysicsStepSystems::BroadPhase**<br/>用包围范围建立潜在接触集合。" }
  class n10 node_system_set
  n11@{ shape: lin-rect, label: "**PhysicsDiagnosticsSystems::Reset**<br/>开始新物理步前重置诊断采样。" }
